    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try\u00fc Sora is a\u00a0vertical-scrolling space shooter, and a heartfelt tribute to the classic arcade space shooters that defined a generation. Inspired by legends like Galaga, Phoenix, Warblade, Tyrian 2000, Dawn Rider and Slap Fight, it combines the timeless charm of the 80s and 90s with modern twists for an unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game isn\u2019t just a nod to the past - it\u2019s the game the developer always dreamed of playing. Crafted with love and attention to detail, Try\u00fc Sora delivers addictive gameplay, stunning pixel art, and a captivating synthwave and cyberpunk soundtracks that channels the golden age of arcade gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Crafted Campaign Mode: Designed to be learned and mastered, every level is meticulously built with unique challenges and patterns that reward skill and perseverance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flow Mode: A faster, randomized game mode perfect for quick, high-energy sessions - pure fun on demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and Achievements: Unearth hidden treasures, discover secret modules, and unlock achievements as you explore every corner of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-Up and Upgrade: Equip your ship with powerful weapons and find hidden modules to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Game Modes: From enemy rushes and boss battles to bonus stages and debris dodging, each mode keeps the gameplay fresh and engaging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synthwave Soundtrack: Let the 80s-inspired music guide you as you soar through space and blast enemies to pieces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal behind Try\u00fc Sora was simple: to create the perfect retro-inspired game, one the developer himself would love to play. Whether you\u2019re diving into the handcrafted campaign or chasing high scores in the fast-paced Flow Mode, this game will challenge your skills, spark your curiosity, and keep you coming back for more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try\u00fc Sora is a\u00a0vertical-scrolling space shooter, and a heartfelt tribute to the classic arcade space shooters that defined a generation. Inspired by legends like Galaga, Phoenix, Warblade, Tyrian 2000, Dawn Rider and Slap Fight, it combines the timeless charm of the 80s and 90s with modern twists for an unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game isn\u2019t just a nod to the past - it\u2019s the game the developer always dreamed of playing. Crafted with love and attention to detail, Try\u00fc Sora delivers addictive gameplay, stunning pixel art, and a captivating synthwave and cyberpunk soundtracks that channels the golden age of arcade gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-Crafted Campaign Mode: Designed to be learned and mastered, every level is meticulously built with unique challenges and patterns that reward skill and perseverance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flow Mode: A faster, randomized game mode perfect for quick, high-energy sessions - pure fun on demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and Achievements: Unearth hidden treasures, discover secret modules, and unlock achievements as you explore every corner of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-Up and Upgrade: Equip your ship with powerful weapons and find hidden modules to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Game Modes: From enemy rushes and boss battles to bonus stages and debris dodging, each mode keeps the gameplay fresh and engaging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synthwave Soundtrack: Let the 80s-inspired music guide you as you soar through space and blast enemies to pieces.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal behind Try\u00fc Sora was simple: to create the perfect retro-inspired game, one the developer himself would love to play. Whether you\u2019re diving into the handcrafted campaign or chasing high scores in the fast-paced Flow Mode, this game will challenge your skills, spark your curiosity, and keep you coming back for more.</p>",
    "short_description": "A vertical-scrolling space shooter, and a love letter to classic arcade space shooters, Try\u00fc Sora blends retro charm with modern gameplay. Master a handcrafted campaign, explore secrets, and dominate fast-paced modes in this addictive space adventure!",
